        "note": [
          {
            "text": "Screening estimate from a photo-based sample using BMWP family scores (Armitage et al. (1983)), banded on ASPT; not a Water Framework Directive classification. A formal classification needs a standardised kick sample, laboratory identification and comparison against a reference site."
          },
          {
            "text": "Almost nothing but the animals that survive very low oxygen. This stretch is in serious trouble."
          },
          {
            "text": "No independent check of the identifications: no vision model is configured, so nobody double-checked the identifications."
          },
          {
            "text": "Limitations: no photo was submitted; the reading cannot be re-checked by anyone later; 11 habitat question(s) went unanswered (water_clarity, water_colour, algae, foam_or_sheen, litter, riparian_vegetation, bank_modification, flow, substrate, sediment_deposit, shade), so the pressure score covers less of the site; 1 of 12 habitat questions were answered; each unanswered one leaves part of the site undescribed"
          }
        ],
